{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_00_016_23_5_00_016_23",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:11e321b0e52ede02f644f010949e9a66554f9562d05837c9bc41f2ec053b9511",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_00_016_23_5_00_016_23:5_00_016_23:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e6c991777a4a5a227fb23b66cb5c5ed33aac3c7aac5beebbf92bb3c5abc59325",
      "text": "见证同伴的活跃身影",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_016_23_5_00_016_23:5_00_016_23:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:34e73cd896f66dd802cdba9d0abbc85b94874a2227efaa28d45e9d9882865b4c",
      "text": "迎来了新年的315 Production。\n偶像们换上崭新的心情，\n与制作人互致问候。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_016_23_5_00_016_23:5_00_016_23:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea15f0062178bd0169d47e1d26243daa8c9fec80c0654669b876b081c7c19f20",
      "text": "新年快乐。\n今年也请多关照呢，●●●●●●●●●●P酱。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_016_23_5_00_016_23:5_00_016_23:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fe953cfe4911872c9942d6984b39ba7918386e462d19ccdab6c7d9daeeb0c6bf",
      "text": "我也是，请多关照！\n大家新年假期都有好好放松吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_016_23_5_00_016_23:5_00_016_23:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5bb1b4c88152cffdf771d521313056ad2fe689598b62c87d8643e2d7f77791bd",
      "text": "我陪父母应酬，见了不少人。\n没怎么好好放松。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_016_23_5_00_016_23:5_00_016_23:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d64db05af36e9e0b1089be9b74de7ad0c0f8b59ea34f46dc849f6e1461ad88aa",
      "text": "我也是，有忘年会的直播，\n岁末年初过得挺热闹呢。天峰君呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_016_23_5_00_016_23:5_00_016_23:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:794a98b3910ea9b5113d82efa4933444f10b1eb226473755253c49386ef2493c",
      "text": "年末年初游戏里有限定活动，\n我忙着攻略那个呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_016_23_5_00_016_23:5_00_016_23:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7dcdbccb52f2eabd5af4f6db7d6ed438308039c7af9bf0589549abff75491c57",
      "text": "不过，百百人前辈出镜的直播我有看哦。\n气氛很热烈呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_016_23_5_00_016_23:5_00_016_23:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ff04a0680bc98570f2b2628c8465e1b5503269b22fc460a2e892fd7de0a7c4c0",
      "text": "嗯。我也看了录播，内容很精彩。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_016_23_5_00_016_23:5_00_016_23:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5a2798ed63289173c9e788e6f981f91bc785bdddd91822db0b4eb6b275972d98",
      "text": "你们两个都看了呀。\n呵呵，好高兴啊。谢谢你们。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_016_23_5_00_016_23:5_00_016_23:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:337eff4df6302daa8c17b5d8a5c14a4870e0bef7f20b9e3eb7066a115e659df7",
      "text": "看到同伴的表现，从年初开始整个人就绷紧精神了。\n再次向各位说一句，今年也请多关照。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_016_23_5_00_016_23:5_00_016_23:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3b58885a6724825c64df8676041ca6294d7f4c8963f21d5fe1d80141f466abf3",
      "text": "好的。首先是开工后的第一份工作，我们3个人一起加油吧。\n当然你也是哦。请多关照，制作人。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
